{"asset_key":"ep7/env_story_17301323","episode":"ep7","category":"env_story","story_id":"17301323","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1730132301:1":{"text":"王子といっても、エイドリアン様は継子だろ？ペギー姫は実の子だ！","source_cn":"奥利安是继子王子，可佩吉是亲生公主！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F1D1FB472B6363E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1730132302:1":{"text":"国王が病に伏せる今、誰が王位を継ぐかも王妃の一声で決まるでしょうね。","source_cn":"现在国王病重，谁继承王位还不是王后一句话的事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE539261BCC5FB692","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1730132303:1":{"text":"惜しいよなぁ……エイドリアン王子、結構いいと思ってたのに。","source_cn":"可惜了，我还觉得奥利安王子挺不错的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB463138B9E8E08F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:平民杰克":{"text":"平民のジャック","source":"平民杰克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:平民茱莉亚":{"text":"平民のジュリア","source":"平民茱莉亚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:平民艾伦":{"text":"平民のエレン","source":"平民艾伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}}